WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:01.960
This is Open Sunsama

2
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.200
an open source planner for your whole day

3
00:00:04.743 --> 00:00:06.160
Your tasks, your calendar

4
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.544
and your AI agent all live in one place

5
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.592
Start the morning on the board

6
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:12.586
Drag a few

7
00:00:12.606 --> 00:00:14.666
tasks from your backlog into Today

8
00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:17.360
Each card shows how long it will take

9
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.940
so you can see if your day fits

10
00:00:20.785 --> 00:00:22.615
Next, give your work a time

11
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.703
Drag a task onto the calendar

12
00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:26.047
then stretch the block to fit

13
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.257
When it is time to work, open focus mode

14
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:31.397
Start the timer

15
00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:33.430
and check off each step as you go

16
00:00:36.918 --> 00:00:37.843
Need something fast?

17
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.483
Press Command K

18
00:00:39.503 --> 00:00:41.340
type a few letters, and jump right to it

19
00:00:42.887 --> 00:00:44.560
Big ideas that are not for today go

20
00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.352
on your ideas board, so your day stays clear

21
00:00:49.053 --> 00:00:51.666
Open Sunsama works with any AI agent

22
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.978
Ask Claude to plan your afternoon

23
00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.567
and new tasks and time

24
00:00:55.587 --> 00:00:57.542
blocks show up in the app right away

25
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:00.364
At the end of the day

26
00:01:00.384 --> 00:01:01.623
check off what you finished

27
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.790
Open Sunsama is open source

28
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:06.250
Try it at opensunsama.com

